  <content>
  <section><para>A baseball is thrown into the air. The following data set shows the height in feet, \(y\), of the baseball corresponding to the number of seconds passed, \(x\).</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-desmos-gc" data-bottom="-10" data-left="-1" data-right="8" data-schema-version="1.0" data-tables="[[{&quot;variable&quot;: &quot;x_1&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: [0.5, 2,3,3.5,4.5]}, {&quot;variable&quot;: &quot;y_1&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: [16,32.7,35.7,33.2,23]}]]" data-top="60"/>
<para>Approximately how long will it be before the baseball hits the ground?</para></section>
</content>
